WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.291 --> 00:00:32.583
In the previous verse, Lord Krishna explained

2
00:00:32.583 --> 00:00:35.875
that a true yogi sees God in all beings

3
00:00:35.875 --> 00:00:38.666
and sees all beings in God.

4
00:00:38.666 --> 00:00:39.958
As a result of this state,

5
00:00:39.958 --> 00:00:43.500
a deep relationship is established

6
00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:46.583
between the yogi and Lord Krishna.

7
00:00:46.583 --> 00:00:48.958
Now the next two verses

8
00:00:48.958 --> 00:00:51.958
describe this very relationship.

9
00:00:56.958 --> 00:00:58.166
First –

10
00:00:58.166 --> 00:00:59.666
in the thirtieth verse

11
00:00:59.666 --> 00:01:01.791
of the sixth chapter, Lord Krishna says –

12
00:01:01.791 --> 00:01:03.833
one who sees me everywhere

13
00:01:03.833 --> 00:01:06.000
and sees everything in me,

14
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.000
I never lose them

15
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.958
and they never lose me.

16
00:01:10.958 --> 00:01:12.958
The first part of this verse –

17
00:01:12.958 --> 00:01:15.625
"one who sees me everywhere" –

18
00:01:15.625 --> 00:01:18.291
this mentions that vision of the yogi

19
00:01:18.291 --> 00:01:19.375
because of which the yogi

20
00:01:19.375 --> 00:01:20.541
experiences Lord Krishna

21
00:01:20.541 --> 00:01:23.375
in all beings and things.

22
00:01:23.375 --> 00:01:26.250
This means the yogi has understood

23
00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:28.250
that whatever exists in the world

24
00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:31.958
is all a part of Lord Krishna's divine power.

25
00:01:31.958 --> 00:01:34.583
And then the second part of the verse –

26
00:01:34.583 --> 00:01:37.583
"the yogi sees everything in me" –

27
00:01:37.583 --> 00:01:40.375
meaning all beings, things, the entire

28
00:01:40.375 --> 00:01:43.375
world is contained in Lord Krishna.

29
00:01:43.375 --> 00:01:45.916
Everything is part of His power.

30
00:01:45.916 --> 00:01:47.250
Lord Krishna says

31
00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:49.916
that neither do they forget that yogi,

32
00:01:49.916 --> 00:01:52.166
nor does that yogi forget them.

33
00:01:52.166 --> 00:01:53.791
Made of love and devotion,

34
00:01:53.791 --> 00:01:56.125
what a sweet relationship this is,

35
00:01:56.125 --> 00:01:59.250
when a yogi has reached that state

36
00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:00.625
where in their heart

37
00:02:00.625 --> 00:02:03.916
they experience Lord Krishna's
presence every moment.

38
00:02:03.916 --> 00:02:06.500
And similarly, in Lord Krishna's heart too,

39
00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:09.083
that yogi is always present.

40
00:02:09.083 --> 00:02:09.958
This verse

41
00:02:09.958 --> 00:02:11.708
also indicates

42
00:02:11.708 --> 00:02:14.583
that once such a relationship is established,

43
00:02:14.583 --> 00:02:18.000
then after that, that yogi, 
forever away from delusion

44
00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:20.125
and ignorance, and close

45
00:02:20.125 --> 00:02:22.500
to Lord Krishna, remains.

46
00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:24.375
Now remember,

47
00:02:24.375 --> 00:02:27.000
in the twenty-ninth verse, Lord Krishna said

48
00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:28.541
that a true yogi

49
00:02:28.541 --> 00:02:31.416
sees Paramātmā in all beings

50
00:02:31.416 --> 00:02:33.750
and sees all beings in Paramātmā.

51
00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:34.916
And in the just-explained

52
00:02:34.916 --> 00:02:36.333
thirtieth verse,

53
00:02:36.333 --> 00:02:38.916
by making a personal reference,

54
00:02:38.916 --> 00:02:41.250
he clarified that such a yogi

55
00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:44.541
is never separate from Lord Krishna.

56
00:02:44.541 --> 00:02:45.416
Now in the next,

57
00:02:45.416 --> 00:02:47.875
meaning thirty-first verse, Lord Krishna,

58
00:02:47.875 --> 00:02:51.000
removing all doubts, says that the person

59
00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:51.875
who has attained

60
00:02:51.875 --> 00:02:55.500
this vision of oneness or wholeness,

61
00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:57.291
always remains with me

62
00:02:57.291 --> 00:02:59.541
in all situations.

63
00:02:59.541 --> 00:03:02.125
If we understand, we'll know

64
00:03:02.125 --> 00:03:05.833
that the 'oneness' being talked
 about here is the oneness of

65
00:03:05.833 --> 00:03:09.291
Paramātmā and Lord Krishna being one.

66
00:03:09.291 --> 00:03:11.208
Lord Krishna is clarifying

67
00:03:11.208 --> 00:03:13.791
that Paramātmā and he are inseparable.

68
00:03:13.791 --> 00:03:16.333
They both are one.

69
00:03:16.333 --> 00:03:19.458
The main message here is that Lord Krishna is

70
00:03:19.458 --> 00:03:21.916
that omnipresent Paramātmā

71
00:03:21.916 --> 00:03:24.666
who is present in all beings.

72
00:03:24.666 --> 00:03:28.041
The yogi who worships him with this feeling

73
00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:32.000
is never separate from Lord Krishna.

74
00:03:36.833 --> 00:03:38.208
Life many times

75
00:03:38.208 --> 00:03:41.000
starts seeming very difficult.

76
00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:45.250
Many challenges, many doubts
come before you.

77
00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:48.291
You go through difficulties.

78
00:03:48.291 --> 00:03:53.458
You face failure many times.

79
00:03:53.458 --> 00:03:54.875
In some such moments –

80
00:03:54.875 --> 00:03:58.708
despair is also felt –

81
00:03:58.708 --> 00:04:02.458
will anything ever be right in life or not?

82
00:04:02.458 --> 00:04:05.250
If you look at it, it's just about

83
00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:07.875
the right perspective.

84
00:04:07.875 --> 00:04:09.625
For example,

85
00:04:09.625 --> 00:04:13.791
when you exercise, there's difficulty,

86
00:04:13.791 --> 00:04:16.333
there's fatigue in the body,

87
00:04:16.333 --> 00:04:19.375
change doesn't show immediately,

88
00:04:19.375 --> 00:04:21.958
but you also know this –

89
00:04:21.958 --> 00:04:26.541
that from this you are becoming stronger.

90
00:04:26.541 --> 00:04:30.333
Every difficulty makes you stronger.

91
00:04:30.333 --> 00:04:34.500
Every failure leaves you with some lesson.

92
00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:38.000
And these are the stairs of progress.

93
00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:42.625
Now along with this, keep me in your heart,

94
00:04:42.625 --> 00:04:46.125
and see from another perspective –

95
00:04:46.125 --> 00:04:51.166
know this, that in every person,
 every circumstance,

96
00:04:51.166 --> 00:04:53.458
I am present,

97
00:04:53.458 --> 00:04:56.125
to help you.

98
00:04:56.125 --> 00:04:59.750
Where on one hand, staying in your heart,

99
00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:03.708
I am guiding you internally,

100
00:05:03.708 --> 00:05:07.625
in external circumstances too

101
00:05:07.625 --> 00:05:09.750
I am present,

102
00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:14.500
so that I can turn you toward the right path.

103
00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:17.041
Whether workplace difficulties,

104
00:05:17.041 --> 00:05:19.041
or some misunderstanding

105
00:05:19.041 --> 00:05:22.583
between relationships, or some
 physical suffering,

106
00:05:22.583 --> 00:05:25.916
in every circumstance, just once

107
00:05:25.916 --> 00:05:29.458
try saying this to yourself –

108
00:05:29.458 --> 00:05:33.791
"Lord Krishna himself is the charioteer of my life.

109
00:05:33.791 --> 00:05:36.708
He has manifested this circumstance
 not against me,

110
00:05:36.708 --> 00:05:39.750
but for my progress.

111
00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:41.500
And if he is with me,

112
00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:44.208
he will also help."

113
00:05:44.208 --> 00:05:49.125
This thought will give you new
 strength at that very moment,

114
00:05:49.125 --> 00:05:51.750
new solutions will start appearing,

115
00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:55.583
and there will be a sense of peace in the mind.

116
00:05:55.583 --> 00:05:57.500
You'll start understanding

117
00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:59.458
that whatever is happening

118
00:05:59.458 --> 00:06:01.500
is happening for the right reason –

119
00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:04.125
for your development.

120
00:06:04.125 --> 00:06:05.958
And I myself, Krishna,

121
00:06:05.958 --> 00:06:09.541
am always ready, holding your hand,

122
00:06:09.541 --> 00:06:12.666
to show the right path.

123
00:06:17.625 --> 00:06:19.833
Think –

124
00:06:19.833 --> 00:06:25.625
what holds a family together?

125
00:06:25.625 --> 00:06:26.833
Is the meaning of family

126
00:06:26.833 --> 00:06:32.458
only living together under one roof?

127
00:06:32.458 --> 00:06:34.250
No, right?

128
00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:37.708
Because you must have 
also experienced many times

129
00:06:37.708 --> 00:06:40.708
that someone is sitting near you

130
00:06:40.708 --> 00:06:44.583
but is emotionally very far.

131
00:06:44.583 --> 00:06:49.041
On the other hand, someone else,
 even while being very far from you,

132
00:06:49.041 --> 00:06:51.750
is connected by emotional bonds.

133
00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:55.583
This is what holds the family together.

134
00:06:55.583 --> 00:06:59.375
An emotional connection.

135
00:06:59.375 --> 00:07:03.041
And when you experience me in your heart

136
00:07:03.041 --> 00:07:06.500
in the form of Paramātmā,

137
00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:09.333
the emotional connection with family

138
00:07:09.333 --> 00:07:12.750
will also become unbreakable.

139
00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:16.375
Because I reside in you,

140
00:07:16.375 --> 00:07:20.708
so I also reside in your family members.

141
00:07:20.708 --> 00:07:24.250
And if you are connected to me,

142
00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:28.916
then how can you be separate from family?

143
00:07:28.916 --> 00:07:31.291
Now think of such a family

144
00:07:31.291 --> 00:07:35.250
in which everyone experiences
 my existence in their heart –

145
00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:41.125
such a family will be filled with the feeling
 of mutual love and cooperation.

146
00:07:41.125 --> 00:07:43.916
In such a case, whatever difficulty comes,

147
00:07:43.916 --> 00:07:51.000
but my presence will keep 
you all tied in one thread.

148
00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:54.291
And the family that is united,

149
00:07:54.291 --> 00:07:57.458
no difficulty can stand before it.

150
00:07:57.458 --> 00:07:59.125
So just

151
00:07:59.125 --> 00:08:00.750
connect with me,

152
00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:02.916
and through me

153
00:08:02.916 --> 00:08:05.416
keep the family connected too.

154
00:08:05.416 --> 00:08:12.208
Then see how your home will become
 a center of peace and love.

155
00:08:12.208 --> 00:08:15.375
Such a center that is a source

156
00:08:15.375 --> 00:08:17.083
of inspiration for all.

157
00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:27.708
Challenges are an integral
 part of professional life.

158
00:08:27.708 --> 00:08:29.916
But the difference between success

159
00:08:29.916 --> 00:08:34.375
or failure comes from the perspective

160
00:08:34.375 --> 00:08:39.958
with which you view these challenges.

161
00:08:39.958 --> 00:08:43.541
For a moment, think like this –

162
00:08:43.541 --> 00:08:46.500
that every difficulty, every failure

163
00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:49.791
is only to help you.

164
00:08:49.791 --> 00:08:55.000
All this is part of my divine plan,

165
00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:58.416
so that there is progress in your life.

166
00:08:58.416 --> 00:09:00.708
When you view every event

167
00:09:00.708 --> 00:09:04.708
connected to me like this, you'll know

168
00:09:04.708 --> 00:09:09.166
that the circumstance – whether
 difficult or pleasant –

169
00:09:09.166 --> 00:09:13.625
has come into your life with a purpose.

170
00:09:13.625 --> 00:09:16.166
Like difficulties –

171
00:09:16.166 --> 00:09:18.000
they empower.

172
00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:21.000
Failures – bring lessons.

173
00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:23.750
This is essential for progress.

174
00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:27.541
And yes, just as I am

175
00:09:27.541 --> 00:09:30.000
present in every circumstance,

176
00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.916
similarly at the time of every problem,

177
00:09:32.916 --> 00:09:36.833
I am with you to help you.

178
00:09:36.833 --> 00:09:40.916
This perspective will give you
 an unbreakable strength.

179
00:09:40.916 --> 00:09:45.416
This is not just consolation, it's a truth.

180
00:09:45.416 --> 00:09:47.250
Look at your past,

181
00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:51.083
who knows how many difficulties
 you have conquered,

182
00:09:51.083 --> 00:09:52.666
and every difficulty

183
00:09:52.666 --> 00:09:57.000
has made you more powerful than before.

184
00:09:57.000 --> 00:10:00.333
If there's some difficulty in the present,

185
00:10:00.333 --> 00:10:03.083
its purpose is also this.

186
00:10:03.083 --> 00:10:06.041
Remember, this circumstance

187
00:10:06.041 --> 00:10:08.500
has come for you,

188
00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:10.583
not against you.

189
00:10:10.583 --> 00:10:12.916
Just accept every event

190
00:10:12.916 --> 00:10:18.125
as understanding it as a part of my divine plan.

191
00:10:18.125 --> 00:10:20.666
And engage in your karma

192
00:10:20.666 --> 00:10:22.875
with complete devotion.
